Instantaneous power, $P=5 \mathrm{ W}$
Acceleration in the body due to applying force $F$, a=$\frac{F}{m}=\frac{5}{m}$ where, $m$ is mass of body
Velocity of body at $t=3 \mathrm{ s}$, $\begin{aligned}& & v=0+a t=\frac{5}{m} \times3 \\
& v & =\frac{15}{m}
\end{aligned}$ Power, $P=F \times v $\begin{array}{ll}
\Rightarrow& 5=5 \times $\frac{15}{m}$\\
\Rightarrow & m=15 $\mathrm{ kg}$
\end{array}

